# YARD binding rules

- Unique job: a quote cannot pass until the supplier’s own public page agrees.
- Spine: AgentMail inbound → Convex quote → Firecrawl unit-price extract → compare → LLM phrases from numbers only → AgentMail reply only if quoted > page.
- Fail-closed: extract fail or LLM/send fail → amber / counter_failed → **no outbound mail**. Never invent a unit price.
- No localStorage for auth or workspace data. Use Convex Auth + org-scoped queries.
- Every business row carries `orgId`. Enforce membership + role on every query/mutation.
- Kill: display-only price board, chat-email clone, AI COO, AFTERCUT, Accra-as-ICP marketing.
- Secrets only in Convex env. Never commit keys or paste them into `hackathon.md`.
- Prefer existing Convex components (`@firecrawl/firecrawl-convex`, `@agentmail/convex`) over custom integrations.
- Host target: `convex.site` via `@convex-dev/static-hosting`. Keep `hackathon.md` current after meaningful progress.
